{"t": 1794138925.849, "event": "run_start", "task": "Hill Climb relay. Stage 1: unplug a USB cable from the power strip and put it down away from the strip (then one more the same way). Never plug a cable in. Stage 2: stack the blocks into a free-standing tower more than 4 inches (10 cm) tall. Do not touch the blocks before a cable is unplugged. Stage 3: put coloured golf balls into the white bin, never the white ball or a black ball, without touching the tower. Do not touch the balls before the tower passes.", "dry_run": false, "stages": ["cable_unplug", "cable_put_down", "cable_unplug_more", "cable_put_more_down", "arms_clear", "stack_2", "stack_3", "tower_pass", "higher_1", "higher_2", "ball_1", "ball_2", "ball_3", "ball_4", "ball_5", "ball_6"]}
